1
00:00:04,953 --> 00:00:07,065
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:07,065 --> 00:00:09,278
Music, Dance, and Mega Trucker!

3
00:00:10,984 --> 00:00:14,046
{Jun} Hey guys! I'm Jun.

4
00:00:14,046 --> 00:00:15,384
{Jun} Now that you're all here,

5
00:00:15,384 --> 00:00:17,322
{Jun} let's watch another episode of Metal Cardbot together!

6
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:20,226
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

7
00:00:20,226 --> 00:00:22,489
Mega Trucker, setup!

8
00:00:23,189 --> 00:00:25,058
{Mega Trucker} I'm Mega Trucker!

9
00:00:25,058 --> 00:00:28,911
{Mega Trucker} I'm excited to meet all these fun new friends!

10
00:00:28,911 --> 00:00:30,999
{Jun} It's nice to see you, Mega Trucker!

11
00:00:30,999 --> 00:00:33,691
{Jun} Today, let's watch the story of

12
00:00:33,691 --> 00:00:35,584
{Jun} how I met Mega Trucker!

13
00:00:35,584 --> 00:00:37,151
{Jun} Shall we get started?

14
00:00:40,551 --> 00:00:42,541
Save me, brave warrior!

15
00:00:42,541 --> 00:00:46,558
Wahaha! It's no use crying now!

16
00:00:46,858 --> 00:00:50,214
The world belongs to Vance, the Demon King!

17
00:00:53,514 --> 00:00:56,532
Not so fast, Demon King Vance!

18
00:00:56,532 --> 00:00:58,770
Is that Jun, the warrior?

19
00:00:58,770 --> 00:01:02,034
What? How did he make his way through all of our troops?!

20
00:01:02,034 --> 00:01:04,835
Looks like I'll have to teach him a lesson myself!

21
00:01:06,535 --> 00:01:08,119
Take them on, Blue Cop!

22
00:01:18,889 --> 00:01:19,800
Mr. Warrior!

23
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:22,754
{Mega Trucker} Huh? Jun, since when did you become a warrior?

24
00:01:22,754 --> 00:01:25,767
{Mega Trucker} Something's strange here.

25
00:01:25,767 --> 00:01:27,856
{Jun} Huh? Strange, how?

26
00:01:27,856 --> 00:01:31,968
{Jun} I'm a real warrior that saved princess Anna!

27
00:01:31,968 --> 00:01:37,568
Ahh... Princess Anna... one little kiss on this cheek too, please...

28
00:01:39,568 --> 00:01:40,532
Wake up!

29
00:01:42,712 --> 00:01:42,812
Hey, mom... good morning...

30
00:01:42,812 --> 00:01:46,952
{Mega Trucker} Hahahaha! Jun the warrior!

31
00:01:46,952 --> 00:01:48,493
{Mega Trucker} Like that'd ever happen!

32
00:01:48,493 --> 00:01:53,908
{Jun} At least I can dream...

33
00:01:54,149 --> 00:01:58,951
A giant robot was spotted in a carpark under an overpass last night.

34
00:01:58,951 --> 00:01:59,902
A giant robot?

35
00:01:59,902 --> 00:02:02,801
Here is the black box recording that became a hot topic over the Internet.

36
00:02:03,801 --> 00:02:06,869
According to an eyewitness, a dump truck approached when he and his friends were dancing...

37
00:02:06,869 --> 00:02:07,827
T-That's...

38
00:02:07,827 --> 00:02:11,123
{Mega Trucker} Wow!~ I was on the news?

39
00:02:11,123 --> 00:02:13,317
{Mega Trucker} Was my dancing that good?!

40
00:02:13,317 --> 00:02:16,863
{Jun} Don't keep attracting attention, Mega Trucker!

41
00:02:16,863 --> 00:02:21,087
{Mega Trucker} Next time, I'll give them a real look at my amazing dancing skills!

42
00:02:21,087 --> 00:02:25,039
{Jun} The news is not "Mowtown's Got Talent"!

43
00:02:25,139 --> 00:02:26,639
That's coming out of your paycheck!

44
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:28,871
Oh no, not again!

45
00:02:38,030 --> 00:02:40,427
There's no mistaking it. That's Mega Trucker.

46
00:02:40,427 --> 00:02:41,198
Is that right?

47
00:02:41,198 --> 00:02:45,332
I told him over and over again to lay low and not attract the attention of the natives.

48
00:02:45,332 --> 00:02:49,207
What are you going to do? This already has over a million views, it's gone viral!

49
00:02:49,207 --> 00:02:51,763
He won't listen to me anyway.

50
00:02:51,763 --> 00:02:53,040
We'll just have to seal him.

51
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:54,510
Seal him?

52
00:02:54,910 --> 00:02:59,288
With the power of the Metal Breath, you can seal a Metal Cardbot inside a Metal Card.

53
00:03:01,388 --> 00:03:04,390
In any case, I need to try to convince Mega Trucker once more.

54
00:03:04,890 --> 00:03:08,425
Yeah, but to do that, we have to go find him first...

55
00:03:10,325 --> 00:03:13,640
Jun. Do you think you could procure a large speaker?

56
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,611
A speaker?

57
00:03:14,611 --> 00:03:16,580
I think I have an idea.

58
00:03:23,165 --> 00:03:25,410
Don't you think this is too loud?!

59
00:03:25,910 --> 00:03:27,150
It's not loud enough.

60
00:03:34,244 --> 00:03:35,729
{Mega Trucker} What's this? 

61
00:03:35,729 --> 00:03:39,213
{Mega Trucker} That Blue Cop guy came up with something like that?

62
00:03:39,213 --> 00:03:42,440
{Jun} Haha! How about that, Mega Trucker?

63
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:44,623
{Jun} How do you like me and Blue Cop's plan?

64
00:03:44,623 --> 00:03:48,730
{Mega Trucker} How did you come up with such a strange dance?

65
00:03:48,730 --> 00:03:56,910
{Jun} I guess it is hard to call that dancing...

66
00:04:01,057 --> 00:04:04,784
This is great! Step on the gas and let's dance the night away!

67
00:04:04,900 --> 00:04:09,355
Uhh... Thunderbolt Smash!

68
00:04:09,355 --> 00:04:12,135
Thunderbolt Smaaaa-

69
00:04:15,597 --> 00:04:18,060
{Mega Trucker} Hahaha!

70
00:04:18,060 --> 00:04:20,723
{Mega Trucker} Blue Cop's slapstick humor really cracks me up!

71
00:04:20,723 --> 00:04:24,793
{Jun} It was my first time using the Metal Breath, so I wasn't familiar with it yet!

72
00:04:25,305 --> 00:04:28,352
Jun, I'm okay! Just give me the next command!

73
00:04:31,131 --> 00:04:33,253
Blue Cop, Burst Shot!

74
00:04:34,634 --> 00:04:36,138
Burst Shot!

75
00:04:40,239 --> 00:04:40,927
Great!

76
00:04:40,927 --> 00:04:42,209
{Jun} How about that?

77
00:04:42,209 --> 00:04:45,290
{Jun} Burst Shot sure packed a punch!

78
00:04:45,290 --> 00:04:47,295
{Mega Trucker} It was a pretty good plan,

79
00:04:47,295 --> 00:04:49,300
{Mega Trucker} I'll give you that.

80
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:56,250
{Jun} Huh? It's weird to suddenly hear a compliment from you!

81
00:04:57,450 --> 00:04:58,625
Megabolt...

82
00:05:03,246 --> 00:05:04,720
Punch!!

83
00:05:12,792 --> 00:05:14,659
{Jun} How was that, everyone?

84
00:05:14,659 --> 00:05:17,128
{Jun} That was my first time succesfully sealing a Cardbot!

85
00:05:17,128 --> 00:05:19,664
{Jun} You have no idea how happy I was!

86
00:05:19,664 --> 00:05:23,851
{Jun} Now then, please look forward to the next "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!

